================================================================================
6. PRIOR WORK AND ATTRIBUTION
================================================================================

This repository is the personally-authored subset of an earlier project that
began as a three-person university course project
(`esci-search-ranking-system`). The ownership boundary is documented in
MIGRATION_PLAN.md §7, which was verified against git history.

Components originating with teammates — the baseline and advanced MLP
rerankers, the Two-Tower V0 encoder, the ESCI-S integration, the interactive
GUI, and the current BM25 retrieval module — are NOT part of this repository.
Where a result from that prior work is cited here, docs/prior_work.md names its
originator.

One dependency on that prior work survives as DATA rather than code: the
`semantic_score` column of the optional Layer 2 feature matrix was produced by
a group-originated Two-Tower V0 checkpoint that is not distributed here
(MIGRATION_PLAN.md §4.2, §10.3). It is required only by the optional Phase 6b
LambdaMART reproduction under legacy/, and never by the main pipeline.
